        {
            "title": "Verified for Steam Deck: Play The Inner World wherever you want!",
            "date": "2022-06-27 13:48:48",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4474904295745070344",
            "content": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/5160856/96abe9bcc9b2156e164fbc23e5e297c081f431ea.jpg[/img]\n\nGreetings adventurers!\n\nSome good news for all you beloved adventurers out there (in case you are one of the lucky fellas that own a [b]Steam Deck[/b] of course): [b]The Inner World[/b] was recently reviewed and got verified for the Steam Deck! ːsteamhappyː\n\nAs of now you can enjoy the game in all its glory on the [b]Steam Deck[/b] wherever you are: in the summer sun on the balcony, on top of the highest mountain, in the bathroom (if it takes a little longer...) - just about anywhere!\n\nOn to adventure, friends!\nYour The Inner World Team\n\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/251430/The_Inner_World/"
        },
        {
            "title": "Special deal for fans of Studio Fizbin: Save now on “Minute of Islands”",
            "date": "2021-06-14 04:42:21",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5019805792174931567",
            "content": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/5160856/922877a48e4807548b103d88bbb438af17c3696c.jpg[/img]\n\nGreeting adventurers!\n\n[b]Minute of Islands[/b] is the newest game by Studio Fizbin, the makers of The Inner World I and II. It’s their first puzzle platforming game and brings Studio Fizbin’s signature comic-book art style to vivid life. \n\nYou can now visit the sprawling islands and the alien labyrinths below them while guiding  young mechanic Mo on her quest to repair a world on the brink of collapse. And the best thing is: If you already own one of the Inner World games on Steam, [b]you get 10% off[/b]! \n\nThis deal runs from [b]08:30 PST on June 14th to 09:00 PST June 28th[/b] (14 days). Just head over to [b]Minute of Islands[/b]’ Steam page to buy the game and you’ll automatically get the discount.\n\n[previewyoutube=V6V7AZCRYBQ;full][/previewyoutube]\n\nYou are Mo, a skilled tinkerer, living with her family on a pastoral archipelago, once inhabited by an ancient race of inscrutable giants. Their otherworldly but vital machines, festering in the underbellies of the islands, must be kept going or an ever-present threat will swallow all. \n\nThe islands are engulfed in clouds of poisonous spores. The only thing keeping them inhabitable are mysterious antennas built when the giants still lived on the surface alongside people. But the machines are now failing, and only one person can repair them: Mo and her versatile Omni Switch. \n\nDriven to protect her family and friends, Mo sets out on a quest to save her world. But, as she uncovers the truth of the islands and the giants that live below the surface, she begins to learn that her focus and ambition may not always be the assets she believes them to be. Haunted by memories, Mo’s journey of the islands of her home becomes a trip into the depths of her subconscious.\n\n[list][*] Wield the powerful Omni Switch throughout story-based environmental puzzles and platform gameplay to regain control over the giants’ machines. \n[*] Face the dark truth beneath the islands’ surfaces and unravel an emotional poetic story, narrated by actress Megan Gay. \n[*] Explore a fantastic handcrafted world across multiple unique islands, meet curious characters and creatures, and uncover the archipelago’s secrets.[/list]\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1049710/Minute_of_Islands/"
        },
        {
            "title": "Developer Live-Stream at 7.30pm (CET) / 10.30am (PST)!",
            "date": "2019-06-06 10:37:52",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2411028931140073438",
            "content": "[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/5160856/1f87a1c1203e841395f456d16aae03227e2a2de7.gif[/img]\r\n\r\nHey fellow adventurers - it's Headups 10th Birthday! To celebrate the day [b]The Inner World[/b] is 75% off and the developers [b]Sebastian[/b] and [b]Pepe[/b] from Studio Fizbin stream the game today [b]at 7.30pm (CET) / 10.30am (PST)[/b]!\r\n\r\nThe developer stream will take place directly on top of the [b]The Inner World[/b] Steam product page. Join the devs, Robert, Laura and Peck on their way to save Asposia!\r\n\r\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/251430]https://store.steampowered.com/app/251430[/url]"
        },
        {
            "title": "John-Approved Adventuring: Inner World Sequel In 2017",
            "date": "2016-08-16 13:52:35",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/rps/252585986937201631",
            "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/images/16/aug/16innerworld2.jpg\" title=\"Happy days!\" /></p>\n<p>&#8220;It&#8217;s obvious that a great deal of love has gone into The Inner World,&#8221; our John said <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/2013/10/01/wot-i-think-the-inner-world/\">in reviewing the adventure game</a>, &#8220;because a great deal of it comes back out again as you play.&#8221; He really liked it, see. Good news, Johnno!</p>\n<p>As there&#8217;s no better time or place to announce an adventure game than Gamescom, publishers Headup Games today <a href=\"http://www.headupgames.com/conpresso/_rubric/detail.php?rubric=EN+Startseite&#038;nr=4460\">announced</a> a sequel. It&#8217;s named The Inner World: The Last Wind Monk [<a href=\"http://innerworld-game.com/index_TIW2_en.html\">official site</a>] and it&#8217;s due in 2017. For now, a wee teaser trailer:</p>\n<p> &#8230; [<a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/2016/08/16/the-inner-world-the-last-wind-monk-announced/\">visit site to read more</a>]</p>\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "Holy Asposian! The Inner World now with the ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK as DLC & Bundle!",
            "date": "2014-03-28 06:31:26",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/919039782923988422",
            "content": "Not only we took a lot of time to create our world of Asposia graphically, we also spent a whole bunch to create a soundtrack fitting into the world as we would imagine, the atmospehre and music would be in Asposia.\r\n\r\nWe love the result, and apparently lot sof people love it, too. So we decided to make the OST officially available for everyone, who wants it. \r\n\r\nIf you still haven't played \"The Inner World\", you can also get a complete Bundle, including the full game with the mini-game \"Flute Nose\" and the OST.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the music, enjoy the game, enjoy Asposia!"
        },
