        {
            "title": "Learn more about the world of Asposia!",
            "date": "2013-12-26 09:54:35",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1010228712025553841",
            "content": "You already explored Asposia? You solvev the mystery of the wind gods?\r\n\r\nJoin us on our journey and learn more about the world you love. As a special gift for Christmas time we invite you to join our YouTube channel and watch short clips about your favorite \"INNER WORLD\"!\r\nhttp://www.youtube.com/user/StudioFizbin1\r\n\r\nStart with episode 1 of \"WONDERFUL ASPOSIA\": Ecomomics:\r\nhttp://youtu.be/kSQI0nPHoGU\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso available in German: http://youtu.be/ZZietAO3CSg"
        },
        {
            "title": "Learn more about the world of Asposia!",
            "date": "2013-12-26 09:54:35",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3819571572130727429",
            "content": "You already explored Asposia? You solvev the mystery of the wind gods?\r\n\r\nJoin us on our journey and learn more about the world you love. As a special gift for Christmas time we invite you to join our YouTube channel and watch short clips about your favorite \"INNER WORLD\"!\r\nhttp://www.youtube.com/user/StudioFizbin1\r\n\r\nStart with episode 1 of \"WONDERFUL ASPOSIA\": Ecomomics:\r\nhttp://youtu.be/kSQI0nPHoGU\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso available in German: http://youtu.be/ZZietAO3CSg"
